{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1132946-no-chronicles-of-darkness-facebook-tag","id":1132946,"title":"No 'Chronicles of Darkness' Facebook Tag?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-08-23T01:40:02-07:00","id":1132946,"title":"No 'Chronicles of Darkness' Facebook Tag?","content":"I'm administrator of Polish FB group about Chronicles of Darkness games. <b>For months</b>, every couple of weeks, I try to add 'Chronicles of Darkness' Tag to groups description ( next to 'Onyx Path Publishing' i 'RPGs' ) but cannot, as it don't finds Chronicles of Darkness Facebook page on the list ( or something like that ) - there are not 'Chronicles of Darkness'-'Chronicles of Darkness' prompts on the list, as phrases with 'Chronicles' and 'Darkness' are popular ones. Now I use 'World of Darkness' Tag, but it's misleading some of users. Maybe OPP should take care for their brand recognition on Facebook?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-23T08:58:27-07:00","id":1133033,"title":"","content":"Maybe pester WW about it? It's WW's brand, not OPP's, and one of the downsides about their hands off approach towards letting OPP develop the games as they see fit, is that they seem to forget frequently that this impacts marketing and community support for things that aren't the WoD.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-23T09:46:42-07:00","id":1133051,"title":"","content":"I do not think (nu)WW will do anything more for sustaining CoD brand as it is. Onyx Path is much more concerned by the well being of the brand, as active writing books for it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-23T13:01:12-07:00","id":1133125,"title":"","content":"Yes... I understand. However since neither of us know the specifics of OPP license agreement with WW, it seems safer to assume that if it hasn't happened, it's more because WW doesn't care about it than because OPP is dropping the ball on it. Most of the FB pages for this were made during the CCP era and have continued, are WoD focused, or ones OPP doesn't need WW to sign off on (Trinity and Scion both have FB pages for example).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-23T13:07:37-07:00","id":1133128,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/ChronsOfDarkness/\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness has FB fanpage</a> - problem is that it's not linked and shown in the list when adding FB groups tags, for some weird reasons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-27T13:27:00-07:00","id":1134595,"title":"","content":"As wyrdhamster mentions, it exists. It pops up just fine for me when tagging, as can be seen <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/TheOnyxPath/posts/1824023957685145\" target=\"_blank\">on posts like this</a>.<br /> <br /> If all else fails, if you tag using the exact name of the FB page (@ChronsOfDarkness) then you should get it to come up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-27T23:16:30-07:00","id":1134760,"title":"","content":"Using @ChronsOfDarkness tag worked! Thank you very much, Ian!<br /> <br /> I was writing full name of 'Chronicles of Darkness', that's why it was not found.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster"